sequenceDiagram
    actor Approver
    participant API as Invoice API
    participant DB as Database and outbox
    participant Worker as Submission worker
    participant PayEx as PayEx API

    Approver->>API: Approve invoice
    API->>DB: Save decision, audit and outbox transactionally
    DB-->>API: Commit successful
    API-->>Approver: Approval recorded

    Worker->>DB: Read pending outbox item
    DB-->>Worker: Return submission details
    Worker->>PayEx: Submit with stable idempotency key
    PayEx-->>Worker: Return result

    alt Success
        Worker->>DB: Save provider reference and completed status
    else Failure
        Worker->>DB: Record failure
    else Timeout
        Worker->>DB: Record unknown outcome
        Note over Worker,PayEx: Retry with the same key if supported
        Note over Worker,PayEx: Otherwise reconcile before resubmission
    end

    Note over API,PayEx: PROPOSED DESIGN - NOT IMPLEMENTED
